  "kanji": "課",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 課\ntitle: lesson; organizational division\njlpt: 2\ntags: [jlpt-n2, grade-4, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 15\nradical: 言\nradicalNumber: 149\nonyomi: [カ]\nkunyomi: []\ndistractors: [果, 菓, 諸]\n---\n\n# 課 — lesson; organizational division\n\n**Strokes:** 15 · **Key (radical):** 言 (no. 149) · **JLPT:** N2 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n課 names a lesson or a section within an organization. It also counts lessons or chapters; the context distinguishes a unit in a textbook from a unit in an office.\n\nIts imposing or assigning use appears in 課税 かぜい, taxation: imposing a tax rather than teaching a tax lesson.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** Imagine 言 delivering the 果 on the right as the result of an assigned lesson. This is a memory story using modern shapes, not an etymological analysis.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| カ | on | [課](../words/課.md) か - lesson; organizational section; counter for lessons; [日課](../words/日課.md) にっか - daily routine |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [課](../words/課.md) か - lesson; organizational section\n- [日課](../words/日課.md) にっか - daily routine; daily work\n- [課長](../words/課長.md) かちょう - section manager\n- 課題 かだい - subject; assignment; problem to solve\n- [課税](../words/課税.md) かぜい - taxation; imposing tax\n- [課程](../words/課程.md) かてい - curriculum; course of study\n\n## Notes\n\n- The right side resembles [果](果.md), but the left-hand 言 distinguishes 課. [菓](菓.md) instead has 艹 above 果 and concerns sweets.\n- 課長 heads an organizational section; it does not mean a teacher in charge of a textbook lesson. Learn which sense of 課 the whole expression selects.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-10-21 snapshot. Word pairs: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1195710, 1195790, 1195820, 1195840, 1195850, 1463860.\n",
